  "text": "Skip to content\nJoin DawaLink as a pharmacy\n\nList the boxes that expire soon, at a discount. Clients reserve them and pay at your counter.\n\nAfter you confirm your email, our team checks your licence and your pin. You get an email when your pharmacy is approved; then you can list your boxes.\n\nYour account\nEmail\nPassword\nAt least 10 characters\n(missing)\nA capital letter (A to Z)\n(missing)\nA small letter (a to z)\n(missing)\nA number\n(missing)\nA symbol, like ! ? @ # -\n(missing)\nYour pharmacy\nPharmacy name\n\nAs on your sign. Clients see it.\n\nLicence number\nPhone\n\nA Lebanese number, for example 01 234 567. Clients may call it.\n\nAddress\nDistrict\nAkkar\nAley\nBaabda\nBaalbek\nBatroun\nBeirut\nBint Jbeil\nBsharri\nChouf\nHasbaya\nHermel\nJbeil\nJezzine\nKeserwan\nKoura\nMarjeyoun\nMatn\nMiniyeh-Danniyeh\nNabatieh\nRashaya\nSidon\nTripoli\nTyre\nWest Beqaa\nZahle\nZgharta\nWhere is your pharmacy?\nTap the map to put the pin on your pharmacy. You can drag it. Our team checks it against your address.\n+\n−\n© OpenStreetMap contributors\nPut the pin at the centre of the map\nOpening hours\nMonday\nto\n+ reopens later\nTuesday\nto\n+ reopens later\nWednesday\nto\n+ reopens later\nThursday\nto\n+ reopens later\nFriday\nto\n+ reopens later\nSaturday\nto\n+ reopens later\nSunday\nClosed\nFor a pharmacy open until midnight, close at 00:00.\nHow long do you keep a reservation?\n1 day\n2 days\n3 days\nA client chooses a pickup day within this time. Not picked up: back to your stock.\n\nSealed, in-date packs only. Never above the public price. Keep your quantities up to date, and check your reservations every day.\n\nI agree to these terms\nRegister my pharmacy\nI already have an account",
